# NEEDS-NATIVE-REVIEW: drafted by machine, not yet checked by a native speaker.
#: scripts/interface.gd:1381
msgid "Sentinels counter armoured units such as Disruptors. Disruptors counter heavy units such as Walkers. Walkers destroy buildings. Disruptor and Walker shells travel and splash. Every combat unit has one ability on the first grid slot: the Scout's sweep reveals an area, the Sentinel fires faster, the Disruptor's EMP stuns, the Walker braces for range. Scout first: enemies outside your vision cannot be targeted, though buildings you have seen stay marked."
